data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":98,"item_id":"msg_0dd508a1ed370425016ae191aff5788191abe69cf027e59400","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"decision\":\"no_action\",\"rationale\":\"The report supplies the environment and versions, the exact `eslint ./ --fix` command, a workload of roughly 9,000 files with extensive autofixable issues, expected behaviour, and an EMFILE stack trace in `ESLint.outputFixes`. This sufficiently identifies the large-scale fix-writing reproduction path. The particular rule configuration and repository contents are not necessary to reconstruct that path.\",\"clarification\":null}","logprobs":[]}

